      "id": "post-1785977592678",
      "title": "FALL - 2026 TRYOUTS - AUG 26 - 27 @ 2-4 PM  (Newland St.)",
      "body": "All players wishing to tryout for the Edison HS Boys Beach Volleyball program need to be at tryouts on both of the following dates: Aug 26 and 27 from 2–4 PM. Save the dates.\n\nHere is the form to register:\nhttps://forms.gle/VUDPQryYfoDMfkE17",
      "date": "August 5, 2026"
    },
    {
      "id": "post-1774305806973",
      "title": "Tryouts – Late August",
      "body": "Tryouts are typically held the week before school starts. Many other schools and teams already have a head start, as their seasons begin earlier.\n\nWe expect to hold two days of tryouts, with teams finalized the following week so we can prepare for our first games.",
      "date": "March 23, 2026"
    },
